## API

- [REST API documentation]({{ baseUrl }}api/v1/docs/): interactive Swagger UI documentation of the public JSON API, no authentication needed, CORS enabled
- [OpenAPI specification]({{ baseUrl }}api-docs/hamtest-api.yaml): machine-readable OpenAPI 3 description of all endpoints
- [Topics]({{ url('api-v1-get-topics') }}?licenceClass=A): `GET /api/v1/topics` lists topics with their IDs, slugs and question counts, `licenceClass` is `A` or `N`
- [Random questions]({{ url('api-v1-get-random-questions') }}?licenceClass=A&count=10): `GET /api/v1/random-questions` returns random questions, optionally filtered by comma-separated `topicSlug` and `licenceClass`, `count` 1-100
- [Questions by IDs]({{ url('api-v1-get-questions-by-ids', {questionIds: '1,2,3'}) }}): `GET /api/v1/questions/{ids}` returns up to 100 questions by comma-separated IDs, in the requested order
- [Mock exam]({{ url('api-v1-get-test') }}?licenceClass=A): `GET /api/v1/get-test` composes a random test following the official exam criteria; answers are evaluated with `POST /api/v1/evaluate-test`

